{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111097","id":3471434233,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6rcXTp","number":111097,"title":"Use `AHashMap` for `classes` in `ClassDB`","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5796,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T09:35:07Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-09-30T23:53:21Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:09Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111097","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111097.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111097.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"`classes` is a major bottleneck for `ClassDB`, and much `Object` related functionality. A \"proper\" type system could correct this problem (https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12323).\r\n\r\nEventually, `ClassDB` will not own class types (instead, `Object` subtypes will own them statically, and only register them in the `ClassDB`). To work towards this, this PR changes ownership from `HashMap` managed ownership to explicit allocations and deallocations.\r\n\r\nAs a side effect, lookups receive slightly improved efficiency (see benchmark).\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\nI used the same property benchmark as in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106646. While not nearly effective here as in that PR, we still see a ~3% improvement from GDScript (and the two are mutually compatible).\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Camera3D\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tfor i in range(5000000):\r\n\t\teditor_description = editor_description\r\n\t\teditor_description = editor_description\r\n\t\teditor_description = editor_description\r\n\t\teditor_description = editor_description\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_usec()\r\n\tprint((end - start) / 1000, \"ms\")\r\n```\r\n\r\nI ran the test 3 times (due to slight fluctuations):\r\n\r\n```\r\nbefore: 1856ms + 1862ms + 1871ms = 5.589\r\nafter: 1824ms + 1799ms + 1811ms = 5.434\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nTo work around the `classes` value type change easily, I introduce `deref_or_null`. It saves us from introducing `get_or_default` on `AHashMap`, which would be less efficient and less versatile.\r\nThere are also some minor performance improvements in `ClassDB` functionality, avoiding the \"if has() then get()\" antipattern, in exchange for `getptr`.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111097/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}